hooks.command:
python3 -c 'import json,os,sys
d=json.load(sys.stdin); ti=d.get("tool_input") or {}
p=ti.get("file_path") or ti.get("notebook_path") or ""
root=os.environ.get("CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR") or d.get("cwd") or os.getcwd()
if p:
    rel=os.path.relpath(os.path.normpath(os.path.join(root,p)),root)
    top=rel.split(os.sep)[0]
    if not rel.startswith("..") and top in ("scripts","export","site"):
        sys.stderr.write("BLOCKED by .claude/settings.json: %s/ is owned by someone else and must not be modified.\nscripts/ is the tracked code of the organizers, export/ is the read-only proprietary dataset, site/ is the shipped explorer.\nWrite your module under router/ and your notes under docs/ instead. Scratch work goes in /tmp.\n" % top)
        sys.exit(2)'
